{"id":10445,"date":"2026-04-14T12:14:13","date_gmt":"2026-04-14T12:14:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=10445"},"modified":"2026-04-14T12:14:13","modified_gmt":"2026-04-14T12:14:13","slug":"spider-removal-service-vs-termite-control-in-melbourne-which-one-does-your-home-actually-need","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/spider-removal-service-vs-termite-control-in-melbourne-which-one-does-your-home-actually-need\/","title":{"rendered":"Spider Removal Service vs Termite Control in Melbourne \u2014 Which One Does Your Home Actually Need?"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you&#8217;ve spotted something creepy crawling around your home \u2014 or found sawdust-like powder near a wooden beam \u2014 you&#8217;re probably wondering the same thing most Melbourne homeowners wonder: do I need a spider removal service, or is this actually a termite problem?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They&#8217;re both pest control. But they&#8217;re very different jobs. And choosing the wrong one wastes your time and money.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This blog breaks it all down in plain English. No technical jargon, no upsells. Just honest, useful information to help you decide what your home needs.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Quick Comparison Table<\/b><\/h2>\n<table style=\"height: 231px;\" width=\"810\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Main focus<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spiders &amp; web pests<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Termites &amp; structural pests<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Warranty period<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3\u20136 months<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">12 months (plan-dependent)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Coverage area<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Metro Melbourne<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Metro + regional VIC<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Best for<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Quick spider fix<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Long-term structural protection<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2><b>Deep Dive: Spider Removal Service in Melbourne<\/b><\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10447\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.23-PM-284x300.jpeg\" alt=\"spider removal service\" width=\"462\" height=\"488\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.23-PM-284x300.jpeg 284w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.23-PM.jpeg 625w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 462px) 100vw, 462px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spider removal is exactly what it sounds like \u2014 a professional <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/spider-control-treatment-melbourne\/\"><b>spider removal service<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> comes to your home, inspects for spiders, treats the affected areas, and helps prevent them from coming back.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Melbourne, the most common problem spiders are redbacks, white-tails, black house spiders, and huntsmans. Most are harmless, but redbacks can be dangerous, especially if you have young kids or pets.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A good spider treatment includes spraying the exterior walls, eaves, window frames, roof voids, and garden edges. Some providers also dust roof spaces and seal common entry points.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Pros of spider removal services:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Affordable one-off cost \u2014 often under $300<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fast turnaround \u2014 many providers offer same-day service<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pet-safe and eco-friendly options available<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Great for renters or homeowners with a specific spider problem<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No long-term contract required<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Cons of spider removal services:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Does not cover termites \u2014 a much bigger risk for Melbourne homes<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Warranties are short, usually 3 to 6 months<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spiders can return quickly if the root cause (insect prey) isn&#8217;t addressed<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Quality varies a lot between smaller local providers<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><b>Deep Dive: Termite Control in Melbourne<\/b><\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10446\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.25-PM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\"spider removal service\" width=\"507\" height=\"338\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.25-PM-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.25-PM-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.25-PM-768x512.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.25-PM-1536x1023.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.30.25-PM.jpeg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 507px) 100vw, 507px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Termite control is a different beast altogether. Termites are silent destroyers. They eat through timber from the inside out, and by the time you notice visible damage, they&#8217;ve often been active for months \u2014 sometimes years.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Melbourne&#8217;s climate makes it a hotspot for subterranean termites. Suburbs like Mount Waverley, Mornington Peninsula, and leafy areas across the eastern suburbs see regular termite activity every year.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/termite-pest-control\/\"><b>professional termite service<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> starts with a full inspection using thermal imaging and moisture meters to detect hidden activity. From there, treatment options include liquid chemical barriers around the home&#8217;s foundation, baiting systems placed in the soil, or direct colony treatment if an active infestation is found.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Costs vary widely. A termite inspection might run $350 to $467, while a full chemical barrier treatment can cost anywhere from $800 to well over $5,000 depending on your property size and the severity of the problem.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Pros of professional termite control:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Protects your home&#8217;s structural integrity \u2014 termites cause billions in damage annually across Australia<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Modern bait systems are non-intrusive and chemical-free<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Annual inspections catch problems early before costly repairs are needed<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Detailed written reports give you a clear picture of your property&#8217;s risk<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Coverage typically includes a 12-month warranty with inspection plans<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Cons of termite control:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Higher upfront cost than spider treatments<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some large providers like Flick and Rentokil have attracted complaints about lock-in contracts and billing issues<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full barrier treatments can be disruptive \u2014 may require garden or perimeter access<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Not ideal if your only issue is visible spiders \u2014 overkill for a simple spider problem<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><b>Who Should Choose Which?<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><b>Choose a spider removal service if:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You&#8217;ve seen redbacks or white-tails around your home or garden<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want a quick, affordable treatment without committing to an ongoing plan<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You&#8217;re renting and just need the immediate problem sorted<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You&#8217;ve already had a termite inspection recently and the property is clear<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Choose termite control if:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You live in a termite-prone suburb or near bushland<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You haven&#8217;t had a termite inspection in the last 12 months<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You&#8217;ve noticed hollow-sounding timber, mud tubes on walls, or discarded wings<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You&#8217;re buying or selling a property and need a formal inspection report<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You want long-term structural protection for your home<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Why 7 States Pest Control Is the Modern Alternative<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here&#8217;s the honest truth: most Melbourne homeowners don&#8217;t just have a spider problem or just a termite problem.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They have both. And the current market forces you to choose between an affordable spider specialist with no termite credentials, or a big national provider that charges premium rates and locks you into a contract.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b> <\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">was built to fix that.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We handle both spider removal and termite control in a single visit. No double booking. No choosing between two different companies. You get a fully licensed technician who inspects for both and treats what&#8217;s actually there.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unlike the big national providers, we don&#8217;t use lock-in contracts or hide fees in the fine print.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You get a clear quote upfront, a detailed written report after every termite inspection, and the flexibility to book again when you need \u2014 not when a subscription forces you to.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">And with coverage across 7 Australian states, we&#8217;re one of the few providers who can help whether you&#8217;re in Melbourne&#8217;s south-east suburbs, regional Victoria, or managing properties across multiple states.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you&#8217;re tired of booking two separate companies and paying twice, 7 States is the straightforward solution.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Frequently Asked Questions<\/b><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li><b> Can a spider removal service also treat termites?<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Generally, no. Most local spider removal providers focus only on spiders and general surface pests. Termite treatment requires a licensed specialist with thermal detection equipment and access to regulated termiticides. If you want both done at once, look for a company like 7 States that is certified for both services.<\/span><\/p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li><b> How often should I get a termite inspection in Melbourne?<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Australian Standard (AS 3660) recommends at least once a year. If your home is in a high-risk area \u2014 near bushland, with a lot of timber framing, or with a history of termite activity \u2014 every 6 months is even better. Don&#8217;t skip it. Termite damage isn&#8217;t covered by most home insurance policies.<\/span><\/p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><b> Are spider treatments safe for kids and pets?<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes, when applied correctly. Most modern spider treatments use low-toxicity synthetic pyrethroids that dry quickly and become safe once dry \u2014 usually within an hour or two. You and your pets should stay out of treated areas while the product is wet. Always let the technician know if you have small children, pets, or family members with sensitivities.<\/span><\/p>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li><b> What are the signs of termites vs spiders in my home?<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spiders leave visible webs, egg sacs, and sometimes shed skins in corners, eaves, and sheltered spaces. Termites leave mud tubes along walls or foundations, hollow-sounding timber when tapped, tiny droppings that look like sawdust, and discarded wings near windowsills in spring. If you&#8217;re seeing webs \u2014 it&#8217;s spiders. If you&#8217;re seeing structural damage or mud tubes \u2014 call a termite specialist immediately.<\/span><\/p>\n<ol start=\"5\">\n<li><b> Is it worth getting a combined spider and termite treatment in one visit?<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Absolutely. It&#8217;s more convenient, often more affordable than booking separately, and means a licensed technician can assess your whole property at once. You won&#8217;t miss a termite risk while you&#8217;re focused on the spiders \u2014 and vice versa. 7 States Pest Control offers exactly this: a single visit that covers both, with a written report and no lock-in contracts.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>If you&#8217;ve spotted something creepy crawling around your home \u2014 or found sawdust-like powder near a wooden beam \u2014 you&#8217;re probably wondering the same thing most Melbourne homeowners wonder: do I need a spider removal service, or is this actually a termite problem? They&#8217;re both pest control. But they&#8217;re very different jobs. And choosing the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10448,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10445","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Spider Removal vs Termite Control Melbourne<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Spider removal service vs termite control in Melbourne \u2014 compare costs, features, and find out which pest solution is right for your home in 2024.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/spider-removal-service-vs-termite-control-in-melbourne-which-one-does-your-home-actually-need\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Spider Removal vs Termite Control Melbourne\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Spider removal service vs termite control in Melbourne \u2014 compare costs, features, and find out which pest solution is right for your home in 2024.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/spider-removal-service-vs-termite-control-in-melbourne-which-one-does-your-home-actually-need\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-04-14T12:14:13+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-14-at-1.29.15-PM.jpeg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"6 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/spider-removal-service-vs-termite-control-in-melbourne-which-one-does-your-home-actually-need\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/spider-removal-service-vs-termite-control-in-melbourne-which-one-does-your-home-actually-need\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"7 States Pest Control\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#\/schema\/person\/d2eebd8e6e8b6f07170a10bc11d3dadb\"},\"headline\":\"Spider Removal Service vs Termite Control in Melbourne \u2014 Which One Does Your Home Actually Need?\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-14T12:14:13+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/spider-removal-service-vs-termite-control-in-melbourne-which-one-does-your-home-actually-need\/\"},\"wordCount\":1234,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7states